---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs
    participant Objects as Object Storage
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo coordinator start
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Start coordinator service loop

    loop Until shutdown or service failure
        alt Shutdown signal received
            User->>Vigilo: Shutdown signal
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Cancel loop and wait for service stop
            Vigilo-->>User: Success response
        else Tick elapsed
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Run coordinator cycle
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Call restricted function to claim bounded pending controls
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Apply revision or observe worker quiescence
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Acknowledge matching revision and claim; retry failures
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Restricted function claims up to 16 quiescent revocations
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Settle quiescent revoked runs with bounded concurrency
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Record completed settlement
            Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Controls use direct database calls; unavailable placements remain pending

            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Discover accepted candidates; claim identity, lease and generation
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Bind claimed identity and read protected plan details
            Vigilo->>Objects: Verify roots, configuration, gate counts and bounded chunk pages
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Scope each transaction; replay admission and verify exact local coverage
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Checkpoint progress; lock placements through restricted function and activate
            Note over Vigilo,ControlDB: Failed candidates release ownership, preparation-only runs stay held
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Discover routed execution aliases through restricted function
            loop Serviceable execution placements
                Vigilo->>Vigilo: Acquire alias circuit permission
                alt Circuit is open
                    Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Leave durable work pending
                else Circuit is closed or half-open probe
                    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Discover expired leases through restricted function; retain movement locks
                    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Recheck ownership; recover or fail chunks and settle in same transaction
                end
                alt Placement succeeds or probe recovers
                    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Recovered and failed chunk counts
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Reset or close alias circuit
                else Availability failure reaches threshold
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Open alias circuit and continue aliases
                end
            end
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Read dispatch backlog through restricted function
            loop Bounded dispatch windows
                Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim cursor and bind returned work identity in one statement
                Vigilo->>ControlDB: Prepare run snapshot on the same scoped transaction
                Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Dispatch routed chunk window
                alt Execution placement succeeds
                    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch shard window result
                    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Release or mark cursor drained
                else Execution placement fails
                    Note over Vigilo,ControlDB: Cursor stays open
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Count failure and exclude alias for this pass
                end
            end
            loop Serviceable databases with bounded concurrency
                Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Discover bounded ready candidates through restricted function
                loop Fair page admission within database page and time budgets
                    Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Bounded shard concurrency with one in-flight page per shard
                    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Try page claim, fence ownership, and commit progress or canonical checkpoint
                    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Ready again, caught up, sealed, busy, or deferred
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Visit unchecked candidates before revisiting remaining ready work
                end
                Vigilo->>Vigilo: Await admitted page operations under the database deadline
            end

            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Read finalization backlog through restricted function
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Select candidate through restricted discovery function
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read routed shard summaries in one batch per database
            alt Summary reads succeed and all shard summaries are sealed and valid
                Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim through restricted lease function; write fenced global result
                ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Finalization count
            else Placement read fails or summary is unsealed or invalid
                Vigilo->>Vigilo: Defer candidate and continue other runs
            end
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load messaging context
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: List serviceable outbox placements
            loop Serviceable outbox placements
                Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read backlog and claim payload batch through restricted functions
                alt Placement succeeds
                    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Joined event payload batch
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Acquire messaging circuit admission per publish
                    alt Messaging circuit is open
                        Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Keep durable delivery work pending
                    else Circuit is closed or half-open probe
                        Vigilo->>Queue: Publish with bounded concurrency
                    end
                else Placement fails
                    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Classify, count, and continue aliases
                end
            end
            Queue-->>Vigilo: Confirmed routed publishes or returned/nacked publishes
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Mark ledger published and delete or retry delivery rows
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Log cycle totals and placement failure counters
        else Cycle or shutdown fails
            Vigilo-->>User: Service error
        end
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
